WEBVTT

01:40.530 --> 01:44.240
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.080 --> 01:47.240
[Episode 8]

02:07.230 --> 02:08.030
Which one to choose?

02:11.590 --> 02:12.430
Between these two.

02:12.870 --> 02:13.710
What does that mean?

02:15.070 --> 02:17.270
The flag can summon

02:17.270 --> 02:18.390
Ji Tanyin's spirit

02:18.710 --> 02:19.840
and purify her soul.

02:20.829 --> 02:23.430
Reciting scriptures can help Ji Tanyin transcend,

02:23.670 --> 02:25.590
eliminating all ominous deaths

02:25.670 --> 02:28.910
and guiding her towards a prosperous and smooth reincarnation.

02:31.010 --> 02:32.820
I asked the maids of Xiaoxiang Peak.

02:33.230 --> 02:34.030
They all burry the deceased

02:34.030 --> 02:35.190
in this manner.

02:37.470 --> 02:38.300
Let's recite the scriptures.

02:43.110 --> 02:44.760
Ji Tanyin,

02:45.310 --> 02:47.340
come back.

02:49.030 --> 02:50.700
Ji Tanyin,

02:51.300 --> 02:53.760
come back.

02:55.070 --> 02:55.829
Ji Tanyin,

02:55.850 --> 02:57.070
a native of Pingzhou,

02:57.070 --> 02:58.829
was a skilled artisan of the human race.

02:59.079 --> 03:01.390
She was later recommended to join our Youhu Clan

03:01.280 --> 03:03.600
[The Spiritual Seat of Ji Tanyin, Immortal Maiden and Servant Under the High Priest of Liujiao Palace]

03:01.430 --> 03:02.750
to cultivate in the mountains.

03:05.470 --> 03:07.550
Can't you stay for two more days?

03:07.550 --> 03:09.550
After all, you've died once already.

03:09.590 --> 03:11.150
My physical body is still down there.

03:11.150 --> 03:12.670
If this gets delayed any further,

03:12.910 --> 03:14.190
the body will start to rot.

03:14.310 --> 03:15.550
You're a deity. Your corpse won't decay.

03:15.550 --> 03:16.750
How could it possibly rot?

03:18.630 --> 03:20.510
Tanyin, let me remind you one more time.

03:20.960 --> 03:21.960
You are kind-hearted

03:21.980 --> 03:23.060
and reluctant to kill him.

03:23.630 --> 03:24.910
I'll tolerate it for now,

03:25.460 --> 03:26.810
but if you interfere with his fate

03:26.850 --> 03:28.130
and protect him,

03:28.230 --> 03:29.310
as long as I find out,

03:29.310 --> 03:30.310
I will never spare you.

03:30.360 --> 03:31.310
I understand.

03:32.390 --> 03:33.150
You've already died once

03:33.170 --> 03:34.540
in front of him.

03:34.610 --> 03:36.300
Have you thought about how to explain why you are back?

03:41.190 --> 03:42.590
I am willing to sincerely recite this mantra

03:42.590 --> 03:43.950
for Ji Tanyin,

03:44.880 --> 03:46.230
hoping for her early nirvana.

03:47.150 --> 03:47.950
Yuanzhong,

03:50.030 --> 03:51.020
the ceremony can proceed to

03:51.020 --> 03:52.010
the next step.

03:53.870 --> 03:54.710
What else?

03:54.750 --> 03:56.030
Mourn for the deceased,

03:56.590 --> 03:58.350
express regrets for any wrongs done to her while alive,

03:58.670 --> 03:59.990
so that she may rest in peace.

04:02.660 --> 04:03.990
This is no longer necessary, is it?

04:05.390 --> 04:06.190
Suit yourself.

04:06.500 --> 04:08.390
I do owe her, after all.

04:11.430 --> 04:12.230
Ji Tanyin,

04:12.540 --> 04:13.710
since you arrived at the Liujiao Palace,

04:13.710 --> 04:15.390
we have never treated you well.

04:15.800 --> 04:16.950
I never expected that in the face of danger,

04:16.950 --> 04:19.470
you would die to save Yuanzhong.

04:19.670 --> 04:20.950
Actually, from the first time he met you,

04:20.950 --> 04:22.380
he began to suspect you,

04:22.510 --> 04:23.510
saying you had ulterior motives

04:23.510 --> 04:24.550
and wanted to murder him.

04:25.820 --> 04:27.550
I was also acting on Yuanzhong's instructions

04:27.550 --> 04:29.310
testing you secretly all along.

04:29.470 --> 04:30.510
We deliberately assigned you

04:30.510 --> 04:30.870
difficult and dirty tasks

04:30.870 --> 04:31.910
to do.

04:32.190 --> 04:33.590
Didn't I tell you before

04:33.590 --> 04:34.550
that Yuan Zhong required

04:34.550 --> 04:36.070
eight meat dishes and eight vegetable dishes for each meal?

04:36.430 --> 04:37.950
That was a lie.

04:38.310 --> 04:39.070
Before you came,

04:39.070 --> 04:40.790
he had at most two dishes per meal.

04:40.790 --> 04:41.409
He...

04:43.110 --> 04:44.270
Just talk about yourself.

04:44.310 --> 04:45.350
Why do you keep bringing me into this?

04:47.159 --> 04:47.950
Alright.

04:50.350 --> 04:51.150
Ji Tanyin,

04:51.270 --> 04:52.790
then I have nothing more to say.

04:53.790 --> 04:54.870
Please rest in peace.

04:56.380 --> 04:57.350
You were having so much to say,

04:57.350 --> 04:58.159
but now I told you not to use me as an excuse,

04:58.159 --> 04:59.390
you're speechless, huh?

04:59.390 --> 05:00.950
So it's all my fault then?

05:01.940 --> 05:04.270
I... I didn't say that.

05:10.390 --> 05:11.590
Though up till this moment,

05:12.550 --> 05:14.150
I'm still suspicious of you.

05:15.150 --> 05:15.830
I don't quite understand

05:15.830 --> 05:17.550
why you came into my life.

05:18.070 --> 05:19.390
What was your true purpose?

05:20.160 --> 05:21.480
But just like a lamp goes out when a person dies.

05:22.430 --> 05:23.710
Now that you're gone,

05:24.390 --> 05:25.950
I owe you in the end.

05:28.710 --> 05:29.500
Ji Tanyin,

05:30.750 --> 05:31.720
if there's an afterlife,

05:33.550 --> 05:34.750
remember to stay far away from me.

05:40.030 --> 05:41.150
What's so difficult about that?

05:41.150 --> 05:42.340
Just say you are exceptionally gifted,

05:42.340 --> 05:43.310
with your heart on the right side.

05:43.310 --> 05:44.920
Or that you've practiced the art of feigning death.

05:44.920 --> 05:45.430
Or perhaps,

05:45.430 --> 05:46.830
you accidentally ate a divine fruit in childhood,

05:46.830 --> 05:47.560
received divine visions,

05:47.560 --> 05:48.230
blessings,

05:48.230 --> 05:48.860
protections,

05:48.860 --> 05:49.390
and so on and so forth.

05:49.390 --> 05:50.310
There are plenty of excuses anyway.

05:50.310 --> 05:51.590
He can't verify any of them.

05:54.350 --> 05:55.190
Good idea.

05:55.630 --> 05:56.800
I'll do it then.

06:00.190 --> 06:00.990
What's wrong?

06:02.500 --> 06:05.110
I suddenly feel uneasy.

06:05.790 --> 06:07.190
I have a bad feeling.

06:11.430 --> 06:12.230
Search.

06:24.790 --> 06:25.750
Rest in peace.

06:38.310 --> 06:39.470
I'm going back now.

06:39.470 --> 06:40.350
It's too late.

06:40.710 --> 06:42.550
Summon the wind, spread the clouds, bring the rain.

06:54.070 --> 06:55.590
Did you foresee that it would rain today?

06:56.430 --> 06:58.150
I'm not good at this.

07:13.230 --> 07:14.310
You'd better hurry back.

07:15.150 --> 07:15.950
I'm leaving now.

07:28.150 --> 07:29.550
Why is it you again?

07:29.910 --> 07:31.270
I must find my mother,

07:31.510 --> 07:32.940
no matter the cost.

07:33.030 --> 07:34.110
Let me ask you something.

07:34.310 --> 07:36.040
Even if you find your mother,

07:36.040 --> 07:36.870
what then?

07:36.870 --> 07:38.110
Will she go back with you?

07:38.790 --> 07:40.310
She's just a woman.

07:40.310 --> 07:41.430
How could she possibly

07:41.430 --> 07:42.550
evade the guards' eyes

07:42.550 --> 07:43.909
and escape from this hidden town?

07:44.310 --> 07:45.190
And besides,

07:45.190 --> 07:46.670
at her age,

07:46.670 --> 07:48.310
having given birth to so many children,

07:48.390 --> 07:49.950
in this freezing weather,

07:50.230 --> 07:52.070
she probably wouldn't even make it down Mountain Wu

07:52.270 --> 07:53.950
before freezing to death.

07:55.070 --> 07:56.190
And even if

07:56.190 --> 07:57.630
you two managed to escape,

07:57.630 --> 07:58.670
what good would it do?

07:58.830 --> 07:59.920
Who would accept you?

08:00.030 --> 08:01.470
As long as the Youhu Clan exists,

08:01.470 --> 08:02.790
if the High Priest doesn't die,

08:03.000 --> 08:04.590
our clan will always be

08:04.590 --> 08:06.270
rats in the gutter.

08:06.350 --> 08:07.360
Squeak, squeak,

08:08.990 --> 08:10.790
just scraping by to survive, nothing more.

08:11.750 --> 08:12.740
Then what should I do?

08:13.070 --> 08:13.870
What can you do?

08:15.950 --> 08:17.630
Well, well...

08:26.460 --> 08:28.460
Why don't you go and beg the clan leader?

08:28.760 --> 08:29.550
Perhaps,

08:29.790 --> 08:31.910
she'll be willing to show mercy.

08:32.940 --> 08:33.970
Will she?

08:34.070 --> 08:35.070
Maybe.

08:50.320 --> 08:52.470
The fragrance fills the heavens and earth,

08:52.910 --> 08:55.070
lighting up incense through the Gate of Heaven.

08:55.350 --> 08:57.350
With the scent stretching thousands of miles,

08:57.790 --> 09:00.500
I offer prayers from afar, invoking the true deity to appear at this altar.

09:12.200 --> 09:13.990
Chieftain of the War Demon Clan.

09:20.430 --> 09:23.070
You are a deity?

09:34.110 --> 09:36.230
I am the 75th-generation chieftain of the War Demon Clan.

09:36.230 --> 09:37.150
Li Chaoyang.

09:37.710 --> 09:38.990
Paying homage to the deity.

09:41.150 --> 09:43.910
The War Demon Clan was once a divine race.

09:44.190 --> 09:46.670
They were banished from the Divine Realm for their transgressions.

09:47.080 --> 09:50.160
It's been only 3,000 years since then.

09:50.670 --> 09:53.190
Yet each generation has become weaker than the last.

09:53.590 --> 09:55.390
Not even the perfect body of a battle demon

09:55.390 --> 09:56.790
has ever been achieved.

09:56.990 --> 09:58.020
And yet, you've managed to ascend to

09:58.020 --> 10:00.430
the position of the War Demon Clan's chieftain.

10:00.680 --> 10:01.680
It's due to my foolishness

10:02.260 --> 10:03.970
that I have been unable to overcome obstacles

10:04.150 --> 10:05.540
and achieve the perfect War Demon.

10:06.000 --> 10:07.510
But our clan has acknowledged its mistakes.

10:07.950 --> 10:09.350
We beg for the deity's mercy.

10:09.790 --> 10:12.470
Please guide our entire clan back to the divine realm.

10:16.150 --> 10:19.230
And kill the High Priest of the Youhu Clan.

10:19.620 --> 10:21.750
Then I will grant your request.

10:25.800 --> 10:26.950
The High Priest

10:27.190 --> 10:29.150
owes our clan a mountain of blood debt.

10:30.150 --> 10:31.550
Even if the you hadn't mentioned it,

10:32.080 --> 10:34.230
I also wish to kill him to settle the score.

10:34.430 --> 10:36.390
But alas, he possesses the Divine Left Hand.

10:37.310 --> 10:38.660
We are no match for him.

11:11.070 --> 11:13.150
This blade is called God Slayer.

11:13.630 --> 11:15.430
It is imbued with

11:15.470 --> 11:17.790
the most vengeful and murderous intent in this world.

11:17.990 --> 11:21.020
Pierce his heart with this,

11:21.460 --> 11:23.210
and he will surely die.

11:23.830 --> 11:24.630
Yes.

11:42.550 --> 11:44.470
Ding Xu just summoned all the elders,

11:44.910 --> 11:46.030
but no one responded.

11:46.510 --> 11:47.780
They all declared they were going into seclusion.

11:47.950 --> 11:49.470
But secretly, they sent their disciples

11:49.470 --> 11:50.550
to pay respects to Xinyao.

11:50.670 --> 11:51.550
However, they couldn't even

11:51.550 --> 11:52.470
enter the gate of Medicine Valley.

11:52.720 --> 11:54.060
They are now in a state of anxiety,

11:54.060 --> 11:55.470
partly because of the War Demons,

11:55.780 --> 11:56.600
and on the other hand,

11:56.790 --> 11:58.340
they fear you'll settle the score later.

12:01.030 --> 12:03.110
You don't need to inform me about such matters in the future.

12:03.670 --> 12:05.150
You don't need to investigate deliberately either.

12:06.750 --> 12:07.870
Now, apart from me,

12:07.870 --> 12:09.120
there are four other weapon spirits of the Divine Hand

12:09.120 --> 12:10.070
scattered in the outside world.

12:10.070 --> 12:10.830
Shouldn't we

12:10.830 --> 12:11.990
retrieve them now?

12:13.790 --> 12:15.110
Baitou Mountain is the closest to us.

12:17.870 --> 12:19.030
Are you thinking about Kai Shan?

12:19.790 --> 12:20.590
I miss him.

12:22.320 --> 12:23.110
Alright.

12:23.620 --> 12:24.870
Then let's go to Baitou Mountain first.

12:25.230 --> 12:26.230
Get ready

12:26.430 --> 12:27.470
to depart in three days.

12:27.540 --> 12:28.350
Okay.

12:51.230 --> 12:53.190
In this world, I now have

12:53.210 --> 12:54.490
only one mission.

12:55.560 --> 12:56.820
It is to be with you.

12:57.950 --> 12:59.430
Until your hair turns gray,

12:59.630 --> 13:00.670
and your teeth fall out.

13:02.070 --> 13:03.470
For a lifetime no matter what

13:04.030 --> 13:05.350
I want you to be happy.

13:07.550 --> 13:09.080
I am the person who believes in you the most.

13:10.030 --> 13:11.470
I am the one who, in your lifetime,

13:11.950 --> 13:13.830
will never betray you.

13:21.630 --> 13:22.510
Fool.

13:31.850 --> 13:34.330
[Tomb of Ji Tanyin]

14:21.980 --> 14:22.700
High...

14:37.950 --> 14:39.150
Didn't you just leave?

14:39.150 --> 14:40.310
Why are you back again?

14:40.480 --> 14:41.850
It seems I've died again.

14:42.750 --> 14:44.710
It's one thing for mortals not to worship gods,

14:44.710 --> 14:46.590
but is killing gods now in fashion?

14:46.790 --> 14:48.430
What caused your death this time?

14:49.530 --> 14:50.910
Yuanzhong killed me.

14:50.910 --> 14:52.110
You killed her!

14:52.190 --> 14:53.580
How could you kill her?

14:54.640 --> 14:55.930
I didn't mean to.

14:56.350 --> 14:57.350
She suddenly appeared.

14:57.350 --> 14:58.820
And I had been drinking.

14:58.820 --> 14:59.670
Ji Tanyin,

14:59.830 --> 15:01.190
you're so unfortunate.

15:01.230 --> 15:01.910
You barely

15:01.910 --> 15:03.720
escaped death at the hands of Dingxu,

15:03.870 --> 15:05.630
only to die at the hands of Yuanzhong.

15:05.630 --> 15:06.230
How am I supposed to

15:06.230 --> 15:07.550
avenge you now?

15:08.510 --> 15:10.320
Wasn't she dead before?

15:10.910 --> 15:12.310
How is she alive again?

15:12.790 --> 15:13.790
How could I know?

15:14.390 --> 15:15.310
What do we do now?

15:15.830 --> 15:16.900
Let's bury her again.

15:19.270 --> 15:20.170
For his sake, you

15:20.190 --> 15:22.860
were imprisoned in the Ice Prison for 200 years,

15:22.860 --> 15:24.950
even offending the deities from the Thunder Clan.

15:24.950 --> 15:26.470
Is this how he repays you?

15:26.470 --> 15:27.790
He's become suspicious of you.

15:28.270 --> 15:29.150
Not exactly.

15:30.310 --> 15:31.190
It seemed like

15:32.470 --> 15:33.870
he mistook me for an assassin.

15:33.900 --> 15:35.540
He thought you were an assassin?

15:35.870 --> 15:37.310
Anyway, it's not his fault.

15:37.630 --> 15:38.670
I'll be going now.

15:44.740 --> 15:46.110
Your primordial spirit is on fire!

15:56.650 --> 15:57.930
What's going on?

15:58.030 --> 15:58.950
The firewood has all burned up,

15:58.950 --> 15:59.990
but she's unharmed.

16:02.030 --> 16:03.750
It seems her resurrection

16:04.120 --> 16:05.270
is no coincidence.

16:06.270 --> 16:08.550
In this world, only the War Demons

16:08.550 --> 16:10.430
have such a powerful bloodline.

16:11.510 --> 16:13.310
It's said they come from the Divine Realm,

16:13.310 --> 16:14.510
and were once divine beings.

16:15.030 --> 16:16.390
They need to awaken their bloodline

16:16.390 --> 16:17.590
between life and death,

16:17.750 --> 16:19.620
to achieve the perfect War Demon form.

16:20.110 --> 16:21.470
For them, death

16:21.840 --> 16:23.230
is merely a form of cultivation.

16:24.990 --> 16:26.790
If she really is a War Demon,

16:27.230 --> 16:28.710
why would she save you?

16:29.940 --> 16:31.470
I wouldn't have died without her anyway.

16:32.190 --> 16:33.740
Truly a headache-inducing situation.

16:33.830 --> 16:35.020
Then I'll go bury her.

16:35.070 --> 16:35.870
Wait.

16:46.390 --> 16:47.470
How do you feel?

16:48.820 --> 16:50.030
Seems like I'm fine now.

16:50.860 --> 16:52.200
It's alright, it's alright.

16:52.200 --> 16:53.540
Being burnt alive

16:53.540 --> 16:55.510
would be such a disgrace.

16:55.670 --> 16:56.790
Once this matter is settled,

16:56.790 --> 16:57.900
you must diligently practice

16:57.900 --> 16:59.270
and toughen up your physical body.

16:59.660 --> 17:00.710
No divine body

17:00.710 --> 17:02.190
is as weak as yours.

17:02.630 --> 17:03.620
Without your primordial spirit,

17:03.620 --> 17:05.069
you're just like a mortal.

17:05.750 --> 17:07.069
It was just an accident.

17:07.270 --> 17:08.270
It's okay.

17:08.750 --> 17:09.829
I'm a deity after all.

17:10.030 --> 17:11.270
Since I could become a god,

17:11.430 --> 17:13.710
I must have pretty good luck.

17:20.589 --> 17:21.670
You are being superfluous.

17:21.670 --> 17:22.270
She's already dead.

17:22.270 --> 17:23.390
Is this really necessary?

17:40.720 --> 17:41.670
I... I...

17:41.670 --> 17:42.750
What's happening to me?

17:42.950 --> 17:43.990
It must be your physical body

17:43.990 --> 17:45.590
getting into trouble in the mortal realm again.

17:45.790 --> 17:46.990
Quickly, return your primordial spirit.

18:13.640 --> 18:16.340
[Liujiao Palace]

18:36.250 --> 18:37.330
It's me, it's me, it's me.

18:37.950 --> 18:39.550
Do you want to kill me again?

18:45.990 --> 18:46.910
Coming, coming.

18:48.190 --> 18:49.550
Here, drink this medicine.

18:50.750 --> 18:51.550
Drink it.

18:51.720 --> 18:52.520
Thank you.

19:02.830 --> 19:03.630
You're not dead.

19:05.500 --> 19:07.350
Yes, I'm not dead.

19:07.350 --> 19:08.270
Still alive.

19:08.890 --> 19:10.290
Are you disappointed?

19:10.570 --> 19:11.820
Don't say that.

19:12.430 --> 19:13.310
Since you died.

19:13.310 --> 19:14.550
Yuanzhong was heartbroken.

19:14.550 --> 19:15.590
He couldn't eat or drink.

19:15.590 --> 19:16.750
He didn't sleep all night.

19:16.830 --> 19:17.630
Really?

19:17.630 --> 19:18.390
Really.

19:18.670 --> 19:20.230
And about last night,

19:20.230 --> 19:21.510
you can't blame Yuan Zhong.

19:21.510 --> 19:22.470
You came back in such a furtive manner,

19:22.470 --> 19:23.590
like a thief.

19:23.590 --> 19:24.510
You happened to run into Yuanzhong.

19:24.510 --> 19:25.310
If it were me,

19:25.310 --> 19:26.510
I would have killed you as well.

19:26.630 --> 19:27.390
Then why did you

19:27.390 --> 19:28.910
seal me in ice?

19:30.390 --> 19:31.190
It's...

19:32.630 --> 19:33.430
It's because...

19:34.260 --> 19:35.070
Ice burial.

19:35.470 --> 19:36.270
Yes.

19:36.270 --> 19:37.190
It's our Youhu Clan's

19:37.190 --> 19:38.630
highest-level funeral.

19:38.630 --> 19:39.910
Only those of noble status

19:39.910 --> 19:41.590
can be buried this way.

19:42.110 --> 19:43.270
We couldn't bear to part with you,

19:43.270 --> 19:44.390
and couldn't save you,

19:44.390 --> 19:45.190
so we sealed you

19:45.190 --> 19:46.480
in that ice lake.

19:46.510 --> 19:48.240
to preserve your youth

19:48.240 --> 19:49.190
and keep your body from decay.

19:49.430 --> 19:50.180
When we miss you occasionally,

19:50.180 --> 19:51.510
we can still go and visit you.

19:57.510 --> 19:59.110
I was wrong yesterday.

19:59.110 --> 20:00.230
I shouldn't have acted rashly.

20:00.710 --> 20:01.620
I apologize to you.

20:04.060 --> 20:04.870
Never mind.

20:05.030 --> 20:06.390
It's good that you know your mistake.

20:06.550 --> 20:07.350
However,

20:08.110 --> 20:09.670
your seal has been broken.

20:09.780 --> 20:11.470
The power of the Divine Hand is not to be underestimated.

20:11.470 --> 20:13.070
You can't use it recklessly anymore.

20:14.150 --> 20:14.700
Yes.

20:15.100 --> 20:16.400
The Divine Hand's power is too strong.

20:16.550 --> 20:17.790
So there's one thing I don't understand.

20:18.990 --> 20:19.670
What?

20:19.670 --> 20:21.070
Why are you still alive?

20:22.070 --> 20:22.750
Zifei and I

20:22.750 --> 20:24.230
have clearly checked.

20:24.430 --> 20:26.150
Your heart meridian was severed, and there was no sign of life.

20:26.430 --> 20:27.710
That's why we buried you.

20:27.840 --> 20:29.390
Then why are you still alive?

20:30.270 --> 20:31.070
Well...

20:32.390 --> 20:33.630
There's something you don't know.

20:33.790 --> 20:35.000
I'm uniquely gifted.

20:35.030 --> 20:36.990
My heart is on the right side.

20:37.070 --> 20:37.710
So even

20:37.710 --> 20:38.990
Elder Dingxu's strike

20:38.990 --> 20:40.460
didn't hit the vital spot.

20:40.550 --> 20:41.910
Dingxu didn't hit a vital spot,

20:42.150 --> 20:43.030
and neither did I?

20:43.710 --> 20:44.680
Under the strike of the Divine Hand,

20:44.680 --> 20:45.950
not to mention having your heart on the right side,

20:45.950 --> 20:46.990
even if your entire body was made of hearts,

20:46.990 --> 20:47.950
you would be dead for sure.

20:48.150 --> 20:50.070
I've practiced the art of feigning death since childhood.

20:50.090 --> 20:52.490
I'm able to preserve life by feigning death.

20:52.950 --> 20:53.740
And also,

20:53.920 --> 20:54.830
I once accidentally ate

20:54.830 --> 20:55.910
a divine fruit that fell from the sky.

20:55.960 --> 20:58.160
After eating it, I slept for a long time.

20:58.300 --> 20:59.510
When I woke up again,

20:59.510 --> 21:01.270
I possessed infinite power.

21:01.270 --> 21:03.350
My body also became indestructible.

21:03.710 --> 21:04.430
Anything else?

21:04.460 --> 21:05.100
Yes.

21:05.550 --> 21:07.190
I often have dreams from the deities.

21:07.190 --> 21:08.190
They often appear in my dreams,

21:08.190 --> 21:09.190
blessing me

21:09.190 --> 21:11.350
and promise to protect me for life.

21:11.350 --> 21:13.720
They say they'll cure all my illnesses

21:13.720 --> 21:14.710
and grant me longevity.

21:16.750 --> 21:17.470
Why am I not dead,

21:17.470 --> 21:19.310
you seem quite unhappy about it.

21:19.670 --> 21:21.350
Have you been hoping for my death?

21:25.030 --> 21:26.230
I'm just being curious, that's all.

21:26.950 --> 21:27.870
Anyway,

21:28.190 --> 21:29.240
I'm glad you're alright.

21:29.910 --> 21:30.710
You must be hungry.

21:31.270 --> 21:32.070
I'm not hungry.

21:32.510 --> 21:33.390
You haven't eaten for days.

21:33.390 --> 21:34.350
How can you not be hungry?

21:34.350 --> 21:35.510
Go freshen up first.

21:35.510 --> 21:36.870
I'll have some food sent over.

21:37.030 --> 21:37.910
High Priest,

21:38.190 --> 21:39.430
you're so kind to me.

21:39.590 --> 21:41.060
You really are a good person.

21:41.060 --> 21:42.070
No need to be polite.

21:42.510 --> 21:44.070
After all, you got into this trouble

21:44.070 --> 21:45.430
because you were trying to save me.

21:45.910 --> 21:46.710
Go on then.

21:57.550 --> 21:58.350
How is it?

21:59.350 --> 22:00.270
She's gone back to her room.

22:00.270 --> 22:01.340
She's meditating and resting.

22:01.470 --> 22:02.990
Yuanzhong, you were so right.

22:02.990 --> 22:04.590
This woman is too mysterious.

22:04.790 --> 22:06.750
Even the Divine Left Hand couldn't kill her.

22:07.550 --> 22:10.260
Could she be from the War Demon royal family?

22:11.950 --> 22:12.920
Although she's formidable,

22:13.150 --> 22:14.540
at least she's not very smart.

22:15.230 --> 22:16.910
So what's our next move?

22:16.950 --> 22:17.740
Let's go.

22:17.740 --> 22:18.470
Go?

22:18.550 --> 22:19.810
Didn't you want to find Kaishan?

22:19.960 --> 22:20.750
Let's leave right now.

22:20.750 --> 22:21.510
We'll go far away

22:21.510 --> 22:22.790
and leave this trouble to Dingxu.

22:23.180 --> 22:23.980
Alright.

22:25.740 --> 22:29.090
[Youhu]

22:27.590 --> 22:29.230
Greetings, High Priest.

22:44.660 --> 22:45.540
Mr. Tanghua,

22:45.750 --> 22:47.190
The High Priest just left the mountain.

22:48.020 --> 22:49.340
The High Priest has left?

22:49.390 --> 22:50.390
All by himself?

22:50.630 --> 22:52.310
The attendant Zifei from the Liujiao Palace

22:52.310 --> 22:53.590
went with him.

22:54.350 --> 22:55.160
I see.

23:03.550 --> 23:04.350
Young Master,

23:04.670 --> 23:06.590
Where did the High Priest go?

23:07.230 --> 23:09.190
Zifei is the weapon spirit of the Divine Left Hand.

23:09.910 --> 23:10.950
Besides him,

23:11.380 --> 23:12.350
there are four other weapon spirits

23:12.350 --> 23:14.390
that were sealed away with Yuanzhong back then.

23:14.730 --> 23:16.100
They're just scattered in different places.

23:16.790 --> 23:18.670
I guess Yuanzhong has gone to find

23:18.670 --> 23:20.030
those four weapon spirits.

23:20.030 --> 23:21.110
What should we do then?

23:21.310 --> 23:22.270
Should we follow them?

23:23.910 --> 23:24.710
I'll go.

23:25.270 --> 23:27.030
You stay on the mountain and keep an eye on Dingxu.

23:27.710 --> 23:28.950
Be ready to heed my call at any time.

23:29.950 --> 23:30.750
Yes.

23:42.670 --> 23:43.480
Grand Elder,

23:44.470 --> 23:45.750
The High Priest left the mountain.

23:48.110 --> 23:49.110
Where is he going?

23:49.190 --> 23:49.990
I'm not sure.

23:49.990 --> 23:51.350
It's just him and Zifei.

23:51.470 --> 23:52.630
They're carrying a big bundle.

23:52.730 --> 23:54.810
It looks like they're leaving for good.

23:59.150 --> 23:59.950
Grand Elder,

24:00.430 --> 24:02.670
don't you find this suspicious?

24:02.900 --> 24:04.540
Even if the War Demon is still alive,

24:04.630 --> 24:05.780
they shouldn't have been able to

24:05.780 --> 24:07.150
target you so precisely.

24:07.170 --> 24:09.540
And the seal has been broken.

24:09.620 --> 24:11.500
yet he left so quietly.

24:11.960 --> 24:13.590
Don't you find it strange?

24:15.510 --> 24:16.310
Indeed.

24:21.010 --> 24:22.440
It's very strange.

24:27.910 --> 24:28.790
High Priest.

24:32.350 --> 24:34.350
High Priest, are you in there?

24:53.070 --> 24:54.300
Where did he go?

25:14.980 --> 25:16.740
Stop staring. You might attract something else.

25:20.580 --> 25:21.390
Yuanzhong.

25:21.750 --> 25:22.550
Here...

25:23.230 --> 25:24.030
She comes...

25:24.060 --> 25:25.340
Yuanzhong, wait for me!

25:25.950 --> 25:27.710
Yuanzhong, wait for me!

25:32.150 --> 25:32.950
Let's split up.

25:32.970 --> 25:33.850
Meet at the ferry dock.

25:34.480 --> 25:35.270
Okay.

25:48.390 --> 25:49.590
Where are you going?

25:53.820 --> 25:55.070
Didn't we agree?

25:55.070 --> 25:56.070
No matter where you go,

25:56.070 --> 25:57.470
I'd stay by your side.

25:57.590 --> 25:58.310
How could you do this?

25:58.310 --> 25:59.190
You just left

25:59.190 --> 26:00.470
without even saying a word.

26:13.070 --> 26:14.260
I don't blame you.

26:14.630 --> 26:15.310
But now,

26:15.310 --> 26:16.430
where are we going?

26:20.270 --> 26:21.150
Did you never

26:21.150 --> 26:22.540
intend to bring me along?

26:24.270 --> 26:25.750
Are you doubting me?

26:26.380 --> 26:27.950
You know exactly what's going on,

26:28.150 --> 26:29.710
Why pretend to be clueless?

26:30.480 --> 26:31.780
What do I know?

26:32.680 --> 26:33.510
Still pretending.

26:37.910 --> 26:39.510
A mere spy from the War Demon Clan

26:39.630 --> 26:41.350
dares to infiltrate my inner circle.

26:41.590 --> 26:42.300
What a joke.

26:42.390 --> 26:43.910
When I wiped out your entire clan back then,

26:43.910 --> 26:45.440
you didn't even know where you were.

26:45.810 --> 26:46.870
If you want to scheme against me,

26:47.430 --> 26:48.470
you'll have to wait a long time.

26:48.750 --> 26:50.150
I'm not from the War Demon Clan.

26:50.750 --> 26:51.550
Is that so?

26:52.120 --> 26:53.810
You could be a bit more sincere.

26:54.680 --> 26:55.750
Are you from Wushan?

26:56.070 --> 26:56.950
From Laofeng?

26:57.110 --> 26:58.200
Or from Hemo?

26:58.450 --> 27:00.240
I don't know what you're talking about.

27:00.570 --> 27:01.620
Then tell me,

27:02.230 --> 27:03.430
where are you from?

27:04.780 --> 27:06.030
I have two answers.

27:06.230 --> 27:07.030
But I can't tell you

27:07.030 --> 27:08.110
one of them.

27:08.440 --> 27:09.200
Isn't it the true one

27:09.200 --> 27:10.270
that you can't tell me?

27:12.840 --> 27:14.160
This is too much.

27:20.030 --> 27:21.290
I can't fly.

27:22.230 --> 27:23.870
Well, that's just great.

27:50.190 --> 27:51.670
Why are you back again?

27:51.670 --> 27:53.070
I just don't understand.

27:53.070 --> 27:54.640
Is the mortal world so dangerous

27:54.640 --> 27:56.510
that it makes a dignified fifth-rank deity

27:56.510 --> 27:58.230
die over and over again?

27:59.710 --> 28:01.030
I'm afraid of backlash,

28:01.270 --> 28:02.870
so I dare not use my divine power.

28:03.190 --> 28:04.670
I Relied only on craftsmanship and martial skills,

28:04.670 --> 28:06.470
that's why his sneak attack succeeded.

28:07.110 --> 28:08.790
But this will absolutely be the last time.

28:09.110 --> 28:11.190
I think we should just forget it.

28:11.440 --> 28:13.310
Let him fend for himself.

28:13.470 --> 28:15.340
He won't live much longer anyway.

28:15.500 --> 28:17.640
We can retrieve the Divine Hand after he dies.

28:17.660 --> 28:19.570
Why go to such great lengths?

28:19.780 --> 28:22.450
If you die a few more times like this,

28:22.540 --> 28:24.470
I'm afraid your divine source will collapse directly,

28:24.470 --> 28:25.790
and you'll vanish into thin air.

28:26.670 --> 28:27.470
No way.

28:27.870 --> 28:29.550
He killed me twice.

28:29.550 --> 28:31.110
Twice, do you understand?

28:31.130 --> 28:31.970
So what?

28:32.400 --> 28:34.270
So I don't know if he's

28:34.270 --> 28:35.990
a good person or a bad person.

28:36.190 --> 28:37.440
If he's a bad person,

28:37.470 --> 28:39.350
I'll kill him immediately and take back the hand.

28:39.730 --> 28:41.340
But if he's a good person,

28:41.710 --> 28:42.750
I'd have to stay by his side

28:42.750 --> 28:43.510
for a lifetime,

28:43.510 --> 28:45.300
until he dies and I can retrieve the Divine Hand,

28:45.330 --> 28:46.570
So that I can fulfill my promise.

28:47.790 --> 28:48.700
What's the point?

28:48.800 --> 28:50.000
Why bother?

29:57.790 --> 29:59.350
The deity was right.

30:00.030 --> 30:01.260
I am a sinner.

30:01.590 --> 30:02.670
As the clan leader,

30:03.230 --> 30:05.060
I still can't comprehend the great way

30:05.060 --> 30:07.000
to achieve the perfect War Demon body.

30:08.430 --> 30:09.910
If my father were still here,

30:10.770 --> 30:12.130
our War Ghost Clan

30:12.520 --> 30:14.310
wouldn't be in this situation today.

30:14.870 --> 30:15.670
Clan leader,

30:15.710 --> 30:16.630
please don't...

30:18.310 --> 30:19.110
In the past,

30:20.200 --> 30:21.960
the High Priest had Divine Hand.

30:22.190 --> 30:23.630
and we couldn't do anything against him.

30:24.430 --> 30:25.390
But now,

30:26.140 --> 30:28.030
the deity has bestowed upon me a divine weapon.

30:30.350 --> 30:32.430
With this god-slaying dagger,

30:35.610 --> 30:37.170
even if it costs me my life,

30:37.750 --> 30:39.270
I will kill him.

30:55.910 --> 30:56.710
Where are you going?

30:57.990 --> 30:59.350
Go back and tell the clan leader

30:59.430 --> 31:00.190
that I, Qian Lin,

31:00.190 --> 31:01.150
will take the head of

31:01.150 --> 31:02.430
the High Priest for her.

31:02.590 --> 31:04.270
As long as she agrees to let me take my mother away.

31:07.510 --> 31:08.310
Come on,

31:08.670 --> 31:09.550
give me that.

31:12.550 --> 31:13.830
Stubborn and unrepentant.

31:33.670 --> 31:35.870
You can't escape, you know.

31:35.910 --> 31:36.870
Come back with me

31:37.150 --> 31:38.470
to ask for forgiveness from the clan leader.

31:38.490 --> 31:39.370
Ask for forgiveness?

31:40.110 --> 31:41.870
Asking for forgiveness won't save my life.

31:42.310 --> 31:43.190
Besides, this kind of life,

31:43.190 --> 31:44.270
I've had enough of it.

31:44.460 --> 31:45.390
Let the head of the high priest

31:45.390 --> 31:46.590
of the Fox Clan

31:46.680 --> 31:48.000
help reunite my family.

31:48.000 --> 31:49.870
Stop talking nonsense and give me the item quickly.

31:50.470 --> 31:51.960
Or don't blame me for being impolite.

31:58.070 --> 31:58.870
Stop!

32:05.820 --> 32:06.550
Are you alright?

32:06.550 --> 32:07.750
I'm fine, Captain.

32:42.150 --> 32:43.100
May I ask you all,

32:43.230 --> 32:44.440
how to get to Hulukou?

32:48.550 --> 32:50.190
I wish to sail to Hulukou,

32:50.830 --> 32:51.820
but encountered this place on the way.

32:51.920 --> 32:52.950
The sandstorm was too strong,

32:52.970 --> 32:53.970
and I lost my way.

32:54.750 --> 32:55.950
If you know the way,

32:56.230 --> 32:57.470
I hope you could kindly help.

32:59.630 --> 33:00.870
Go south for twenty li,

33:01.020 --> 33:02.710
and you'll see an oasis.

33:03.150 --> 33:05.540
Pass through the oasis and go upstream,

33:05.580 --> 33:06.730
it's only five li more,

33:06.950 --> 33:08.830
and you'll see a riverbank.

33:08.170 --> 33:09.980
[Du He, merchant of human race]

33:08.910 --> 33:10.550
That's Hulukou.

33:11.990 --> 33:12.670
I thought

33:12.680 --> 33:14.010
I had to keep going west.

33:14.190 --> 33:14.990
Thank you very much.

33:15.500 --> 33:16.850
You're welcome, sir.

33:17.070 --> 33:18.000
When traveling,

33:18.000 --> 33:20.230
helping others is helping yourself.

33:21.430 --> 33:22.630
That's well said.

33:22.780 --> 33:23.590
Farewell.

33:23.750 --> 33:24.630
Please wait, sir.

33:26.390 --> 33:28.540
Here, have some water first.

33:30.670 --> 33:31.780
Judging by your attire,

33:31.780 --> 33:33.030
you don't seem to be from around here.

33:33.230 --> 33:34.550
May I ask your name?

33:34.790 --> 33:35.750
My surname is Yuan,

33:35.910 --> 33:36.830
I'm from Pingzhou.

33:37.870 --> 33:39.350
Oh, so you're Young Master Yuan.

33:40.340 --> 33:42.370
Pingzhou is indeed quite far.

33:42.470 --> 33:43.390
Yuan from 'yuanbao'.

33:43.420 --> 33:45.180
So this is how you've come all this way.

33:45.260 --> 33:46.070
Yes, indeed.

33:47.190 --> 33:48.230
The journey is difficult.

33:48.260 --> 33:50.620
Be extra careful as you travel alone.

33:50.710 --> 33:51.510
Thank you.

33:53.350 --> 33:54.110
Farewell.

33:54.110 --> 33:54.830
Farewell.

34:19.790 --> 34:20.580
Yuanzhong.

34:22.429 --> 34:23.219
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

34:23.219 --> 34:24.230
You've finally arrived.

34:24.710 --> 34:25.830
I lost my way midway.

34:25.830 --> 34:27.179
I took quite a few wrong turns.

34:27.510 --> 34:28.310
Getting lost?

34:28.639 --> 34:29.790
Your bad luck has begun?

34:31.120 --> 34:31.929
It seems so.

34:33.870 --> 34:34.830
Where's Ji Tanyin?

34:34.850 --> 34:35.639
I shook her off.

34:38.179 --> 34:39.030
The ones at the back, keep up!

34:43.350 --> 34:44.230
Young Master Yuan,

34:44.630 --> 34:45.830
here we are again.

34:46.690 --> 34:48.449
Had I known you were also taking this tower ship,

34:48.480 --> 34:49.960
I should have traveled with you.

34:51.870 --> 34:52.520
Please.

34:52.710 --> 34:53.510
Please.

35:05.750 --> 35:06.590
You two,

35:06.630 --> 35:07.470
quickly load these onto the ship.

35:07.470 --> 35:08.110
Okay.

35:09.950 --> 35:11.020
Be gentle with the cargo, everyone.

35:11.020 --> 35:11.790
Okay, okay.

35:15.280 --> 35:16.070
Young man,

35:16.680 --> 35:17.750
[Manager Cao of human race]

35:17.190 --> 35:17.990
young man.

35:38.750 --> 35:40.070
The river here has dried up.

35:40.390 --> 35:41.340
How can we sail?

35:42.350 --> 35:43.830
Young Master Yuan, you may not know,

35:44.070 --> 35:44.880
this tower ship

35:44.880 --> 35:46.790
doesn't travel on water.

35:47.300 --> 35:48.820
Set sail!

36:11.590 --> 36:13.550
This ship is actually flying!

36:15.110 --> 36:16.540
Is it your first time

36:16.540 --> 36:17.750
to ride a tower ship?

36:18.630 --> 36:19.510
Over the years,

36:19.510 --> 36:21.910
our Human Clan craftsmanship has greatly improved.

36:21.990 --> 36:22.910
Riding the clouds and mist,

36:22.910 --> 36:24.670
flying in the sky and burrowing underground

36:24.790 --> 36:26.360
are no longer exclusive to

36:26.360 --> 36:28.150
the Youhu Clan immortals.

36:29.260 --> 36:30.060
Indeed.

36:30.590 --> 36:31.550
Truly extraordinary.

36:32.020 --> 36:32.810
Manager Cao,

36:32.960 --> 36:34.280
you're being too kind.

36:34.550 --> 36:35.750
We don't even know who this person is,

36:35.750 --> 36:36.920
yet you saved him.

36:38.070 --> 36:39.230
Since we encountered him,

36:39.270 --> 36:40.590
how could we just leave him there?

36:41.390 --> 36:43.020
Look at how young he is.

36:43.230 --> 36:44.430
If something were to happen to him,

36:44.510 --> 36:45.670
what would we do?

36:49.110 --> 36:49.790
What's wrong?

36:49.790 --> 36:50.430
This...

37:14.500 --> 37:15.740
The wound is healing by itself.

37:15.770 --> 37:17.450
Yes, I saw it with my own eyes.

37:17.490 --> 37:18.400
Such a long gash,

37:18.400 --> 37:19.510
healed in an instant.

37:28.140 --> 37:29.070
Young Mistress Dai,

37:29.370 --> 37:31.530
you didn't make it to this ship after all.

37:35.430 --> 37:36.240
Sir,

37:38.230 --> 37:39.030
what is it?

37:40.510 --> 37:41.310
Sir, to report,

37:41.470 --> 37:42.140
it seems a War Demon has snuck aboard.

37:42.140 --> 37:43.670
on our ship.

37:45.030 --> 37:46.390
Where did this War Demon come from?

37:47.110 --> 37:48.470
How was their identity confirmed?

37:49.160 --> 37:49.970
Sir,

37:50.360 --> 37:51.510
when I was at Hulukou,

37:51.510 --> 37:52.350
I found

37:52.370 --> 37:53.970
a severely injured, unconscious young man.

37:54.070 --> 37:54.790
Feeling pity for him,

37:54.790 --> 37:55.990
I brought him back with us.

37:56.350 --> 37:57.430
When the doctor was treating him,

37:57.430 --> 37:58.190
We found him.

37:58.550 --> 38:00.680
His wounds healed rapidly.

38:01.640 --> 38:03.030
We arrived a step too late.

38:03.230 --> 38:04.700
He injured one of our boatmen

38:04.700 --> 38:05.670
and managed to escape.

38:06.400 --> 38:07.190
Sir,

38:07.750 --> 38:08.590
the descendant of Youhu Clan

38:08.590 --> 38:09.710
seems to be true.

38:09.930 --> 38:11.480
The War Demon is still alive.

38:11.830 --> 38:13.550
What should we do?

38:15.240 --> 38:16.050
Search the ship.

38:17.020 --> 38:18.660
Find him for me.

38:19.350 --> 38:19.970
Yes, sir.

38:26.630 --> 38:28.710
This tower ship cost a fortune to build.

38:28.730 --> 38:30.080
It's lavishly decorated,

38:30.290 --> 38:32.140
with all amenities for eating, drinking, and entertainment.

38:32.420 --> 38:33.950
It's essentially

38:33.950 --> 38:36.350
a small flying town.

38:36.350 --> 38:38.620
In this world, only

38:38.620 --> 38:39.510
we are capable of such feats,

38:39.510 --> 38:40.950
the craftsmanship of Human Clan.

38:41.370 --> 38:42.520
No matter how impressive our craftsmanship is,

38:42.590 --> 38:43.470
it can't compare to

38:43.470 --> 38:44.760
the magic of immortals.

38:44.940 --> 38:46.910
This tower ship used to burn coal,

38:47.230 --> 38:48.550
constantly emitting black smoke,

38:48.550 --> 38:50.630
and it would fly erratically, up and down.

38:50.630 --> 38:51.630
That was quite frightening.

38:52.070 --> 38:53.310
Since switching to crystal stones

38:53.310 --> 38:54.750
and using spirit-gathering chambers for propulsion, it's been much better.

38:54.750 --> 38:56.190
It's clean and quiet,

38:56.190 --> 38:57.750
but most importantly, it flies smoothly,

38:57.750 --> 38:59.150
giving passengers peace of mind.

39:00.500 --> 39:01.820
Make way, make way!

39:05.030 --> 39:05.950
What's going on?

39:06.070 --> 39:07.990
I heard there's a criminal on board.

39:08.260 --> 39:09.500
They're searching everywhere.

39:10.070 --> 39:11.070
When I came by,

39:11.110 --> 39:13.150
they had already searched the lower cabins.

39:14.110 --> 39:14.910
Young Master Yuan,

39:14.990 --> 39:16.950
I have matters to attend to. I'll take my leave now.

39:20.800 --> 39:21.870
They're searching for a criminal on the ship.

39:21.870 --> 39:23.270
Why is he so nervous?

39:24.770 --> 39:26.650
Do you know that humans have a weapon

39:26.870 --> 39:28.110
called 'flying fire'?

39:28.390 --> 39:29.910
It's made from sulfur and other materials.

39:30.270 --> 39:32.950
Though small, it can split mountains and crack rocks.

39:33.070 --> 39:34.060
Its power is extraordinary.

39:34.310 --> 39:35.110
Yes,

39:35.350 --> 39:36.910
humans have been researching craftsmanship for years,

39:36.910 --> 39:37.990
and indeed have created many

39:37.990 --> 39:39.670
weapons for siege warfare.

39:40.550 --> 39:41.350
Tell me,

39:41.390 --> 39:43.990
if we use that flying fire to blow up the spirit gathering chamber,

39:44.590 --> 39:45.550
would this tower ship

39:45.950 --> 39:47.630
fall from the sky?

39:48.160 --> 39:49.030
What do you mean?

40:01.710 --> 40:02.510
Yuanzhong,

40:02.880 --> 40:05.230
it seems Ji Tanyin is indeed the War Demon.

40:05.430 --> 40:06.350
You're in trouble.

40:14.110 --> 40:14.910
Sir,

40:15.030 --> 40:15.830
what's the situation?

40:16.150 --> 40:17.840
Who are the guards on the tower ship looking for?

40:18.220 --> 40:19.420
A young man,

40:19.450 --> 40:20.740
about seventeen or eighteen years old.

40:20.920 --> 40:22.310
It shouldn't have anything to do with us.

40:22.580 --> 40:24.070
Have the guards searched here?

40:25.030 --> 40:25.910
They just came by,

40:25.910 --> 40:26.860
but I've already

40:26.860 --> 40:27.910
managed to fob them off.

40:27.960 --> 40:29.110
Can you ensure that they

40:29.110 --> 40:30.710
won't come back?

40:31.130 --> 40:32.090
You said

40:32.190 --> 40:33.990
that hiding things here would be absolutely safe.

40:33.990 --> 40:35.190
If someone discovers it,

40:35.190 --> 40:36.260
all will be lost.

40:37.580 --> 40:38.610
What should we do now?

40:41.950 --> 40:43.510
Leave the barrel to divert attention,

40:43.790 --> 40:45.040
but move the flying fire immediately.

40:45.220 --> 40:45.910
Alright.

40:57.490 --> 40:58.300
Wait.

40:58.670 --> 40:59.470
What's wrong?

41:42.390 --> 41:43.090
A Xue.

41:43.710 --> 41:45.180
Why aren't you serving in the cabin?

41:45.180 --> 41:46.270
Are you slacking off again?

41:46.500 --> 41:48.030
Be careful not to get caught by the supervisor.

41:48.030 --> 41:49.110
They might dock your pay.

41:49.400 --> 41:50.920
I'm not slacking off at all.

41:50.990 --> 41:51.550
I've been in the kitchen,

41:51.550 --> 41:53.030
peeling beans all day.

41:53.430 --> 41:54.110
Alright.

42:20.230 --> 42:21.030
Hello.
